Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### GET /transactions/:id — buscar a excluída (espera 404 com "message": ["TRANSACTION_NOT_FOUND"])
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{createPharmacy.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### DELETE /transactions/:id — excluir de novo (espera 404 com "message": ["TRANSACTION_NOT_FOUND"])
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{createPharmacy.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### GET /transactions — a excluída some da lista (espera 200 OK com "meta.total": 5)
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

